        <h1 class="post-detail__title">Celebrating National Philanthropy Day & Our Generous Community</h1>

        <div class="post-detail__featured-image">
          <img src="/assets/images/news/47045.webp" alt="Celebrating National Philanthropy Day & Our Generous Community" loading="lazy">
