        <div class="post-detail__content">
          <p><strong>Happy National Philanthropy Day!</strong> </p>

<p>Today is a special day. It’s National Philanthropy Day! Organized in the 1980s, this day is significant in recognizing the important role philanthropy has had on societal change. Today especially, we celebrate the change we’ve made, the change we’re making, and the change that is yet to come. Today we pay tribute to the great contributions that philanthropy – and those active in the philanthropic community, namely YOU &#8211; have made to our lives, our communities, and our exceptional&nbsp;valley.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>

<hr/>

<p><strong>&nbsp;It Takes a Village</strong></p>

<p>Teton Valley is unique in many ways. Aside from amazing mountain views,&nbsp;one of its best aspects is our residents&#8217; sense of generosity as a community value. Through the Tin Cup Challenge and our community&#8217;s natural tendencies, we have unequivocally developed a culture of giving valley-wide. This generosity has elevated&nbsp;thousands of lives and will continue to do so as we invest, empower, and enrich residents through the hard work and dedication of our nonprofit community.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>

<hr/>

<p><strong>Walking the Talk</strong>​</p>

<p>Our deepest gratitude goes&nbsp;to our&nbsp;<a href="https://cftetonvalley.org/about-us/board-of-directors/">Board of Directors</a>. This winning team has surpassed Tin Cup Challenge&nbsp;fundraising goals year-after-year for the benefit of all Teton Valley&nbsp;nonprofits.<br><br>Two years ago, they diligently set, and have since adhered to,&nbsp;a thoughtful and forward-thinking&nbsp;strategic plan.&nbsp;In October, they participated in our annual Board Retreat where they devoted a whole day to teamwork, personal commitments to the Board as members, and revisiting the Foundation&#8217;s Priority Goals. &nbsp;<br><br>Their dedication is noteworthy and we greatly appreciate their philanthropic leadership.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>

<hr/>

<p><strong>Saying Adieu</strong></p>

<hr/>

<p><strong>Cheers to our newly appointed 2019/2020 Officers:</strong></p>

<p>&nbsp;<strong>Thank&nbsp;you&nbsp;for your philanthropic giving!</strong>​</p>

<p><strong>There&#8217;s no doubt that Teton Valley is a better place because of YOU.</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>
